(B/'PLAN.md').write_text((P/'PLAN.md').read_text()+'''\n## S73 completes the missing factorial cell\n\nActual26313 replay passed full local gates at2830.923547 tokens/s,7.012% below the historical three-run3044.400475 mean despite native-runtime parity. That observation does not establish why earlier controls differ. Completing the2x2 graph/admission study permits graph comparison under both caps and admission comparison under both graph states. This arm keeps prefill graph disabled and removes only the explicit64 request cap relative to S70. Use the same full N64/fixed4000:200/seed2026/60:120:30 and all native/output/error/raw gates. It is a distinct treatment, not an independent repeat of a losing arm or promotion confirmation.\n\nCompare S70/S73 at graph disabled and S73/S72 at native admission; label single-deployment variability and order effects, no exact interaction/cause claimed without independent confirmation. >1% useful matched gain with complete gates is a prerequisite for proposing a confirmation, not automatic acceptance. If the controls fail or the arm loses, preserve it and close that cell. Sixteen H200/two nodes/17-minute maximum/no PBS SU; fresh cap5 and exact receipts mandatory.\n'''.replace('Actual26313','Actual 26313').replace('at2830','at 2830').replace('s,7.012','s, 7.012').replace('three-run3044','three-run 3044').replace('the2x2','the 2x2').replace('explicit64','explicit 64').replace('fixed4000','fixed 4000').replace('seed2026','seed 2026').replace('cap5','cap 5'))
